OL,3,AChildren as young as six going to A&E
OL,4,Ain mental health crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome faced waits of more than 12 hours
OL,7,Fonce there. The college said A&Es were
OL,8,Fnot the best place for them, but a lack
OL,9,Fof support in the community meant they
OL,10,Foften had nowhere else to turn.
OL,12,FThe government said it was looking to
OL,13,Fimprove services and would be setting
OL,14,Fout plans soon.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/41
