OL,3,AIsrael expanding presence in Lebanon,
OL,4,Aofficials say, as BBC visits occupied
OL,5,Aareas
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe drive on the highway by the
OL,8,FMediterranean in southern Lebanon, near
OL,9,Fthe border with Israel, is scenic and,
OL,10,Fthese days, desolate. Crops lie
OL,11,Fabandoned and buildings destroyed by
OL,12,FIsraeli air strikes, too many to count,
OL,13,Fare in ruins.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/41
