OL,3,AIsrael expanding presence in Lebanon,
OL,4,Aofficials say, as BBC visits occupied
OL,5,Aareas
OL,6,
OL,7,FLast month, a BBC team joined a
OL,8,Fhumanitarian mission of the UN
OL,9,Fpeacekeeping force in Lebanon, known as
OL,10,FUnifil, which is one of the only ways
OL,11,Fto visit the area under Israeli
OL,12,Fcontrol. There, as it did in Gaza,
OL,13,FIsrael has flattened entire villages,
OL,14,Fand air strikes and demolitions have
OL,15,Fcontinued even after a ceasefire was
OL,16,Fannounced in June.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/41
