OL,3,ASouth Korea jails disabled care home
OL,4,Ahead for sexually assaulting residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FA South Korean court has jailed the
OL,7,Fformer head of a disabled care home for
OL,8,Fsexually assaulting multiple residents,
OL,9,Fin a case that shocked the nation.
OL,11,FThe man, surnamed Kim, was handed a
OL,12,F15-year prison term for abusing three
OL,13,Fresidents at the Saekdongwon facility
OL,14,Fin Incheon City, west of Seoul.
OL,16,FPolice started investigating Kim after
OL,17,Fone of his victims, a woman with a
OL,18,Fsevere intellectual disability, came
OL,19,Fforward in February last year.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/41
